WEBVTT

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.740
Even as you use your fists to protect someone,

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.380
you're killing even more people!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.040
That's what I mean by hypocrisy.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.880
Tachibana!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:40.340
<b>Episode 6 
A Miracle Is a Cruel Thing</b>

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.150
There we go!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.980
It swallowed a Symphogear!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.240
And now...

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.240
That lunatic!

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.240
How far is he willing to go?!

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:13.250
That's what he meant by feeding 
the Nephilim a relic fragment...

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.380
Where are you going?

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:29.310
I've ordered you to stay here.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:32.310
He's just playing with a human life!

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:35.650
Is this what we are meant to be doing?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.280
We're doing the right thing, aren't we?

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.910
If we are,

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.590
then why do we feel this way?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.390
You must throw away

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:56.060
that gentleness, right now.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.840
We have

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.900
no need for smiles.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.330
Everything is falling apart.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:24.330
At this rate, I will, as well...

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.660
Serena...

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.540
What do I do?

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:34.790
Tachibana!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.170
Tachibana!

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.390
The Nephilim is a complete relic.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:43.170
You could call it an autonomous-breeder reactor.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.100
It devours other energy sources,

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:50.230
incorporating them into itself, 
to increase its own energy output!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.310
It's about to begin!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.060
Can you hear it?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.810
The heartbeat of awakening!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.250
This power will bring Frontier to the surface!

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:19.080
No... It can't be...

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.350
This is what

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.310
Finé's observation records revealed

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.690
about Tachibana Hibiki.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.030
She's gone out of control?

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.590
She's focusing the Gear energy 
into the form of an arm?

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:04.340
It's like she's constructing an Armed Gear.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.760
Sh-She can't...

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.430
S-Stop! Stop it!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:20.730
The fully grown Nephilim is 
needed for the new world!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.320
You can't... You can't...

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.240
The drop in her life energy

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.780
caused the relic in her chest to go out of control?

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:56.720
Either way...

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:58.700
Mom!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.380
Not now...

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:08.740
Maria!

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.920
Hey, Maria! Are you listening?

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.460
Mom isn't doing well...

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.190
Mom!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.550
Tachibana...

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.690
What the hell was that?

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:33.200
Stop it, Tachibana!

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:34.730
That's enough!

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:37.870
Black isn't your color!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.260
You dummy!

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:02.830
Tachibana! Tachibana, wake up!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:03.990
Tachibana!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:08.290
<i>Her left arm is all right?</i>

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:15.570
Mom!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:16.910
Mom!

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.070
Wake up, Mom!

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.330
Get the doctor back here, now.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.790
Bring him back?

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:26.620
I can apply first-aid,

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.770
but for her recovery, we'll need his help. So...

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.480
Okay!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.940
<i>This is all because I can't handle Finé properly.</i>

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.060
Hibiki-kun...

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.090
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.240
<i>Where are Tsubasa-san and Chris-chan?</i>

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:19.400
<i>I see... That again...</i>

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:23.350
<i>I haven't had this dream in so long.</i>

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.850
<b>What Caused the Disaster?      Surviving Families Rage</b>

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.690
I don't know why you haven't killed yourself.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.650
You killed all those people.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:30.360
You didn't know?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.990
If you get attacked by Noise,

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:34.920
you can get money, even if you're only injured.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.610
It's called "Special Disaster Compensation."

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:41.130
That's Mom and Dad's tax money, right?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.950
That's why she's still happy, even after they died.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.980
What a waste of tax money.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:46.860
Right?

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:57.670
<b>Murderer                     Thief</b>

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.550
Welcome back.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.310
Murderer!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.470
Murderer!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.310
Run, she'll kill us!

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.480
It's okay...

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.160
Your mom and grandma are

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.830
just happy that you're alive.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:20.950
Okay?

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.100
<i>I was so sure that, if I worked hard</i>

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.520
<i>at my physical therapy and got better,</i>

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:31.650
<i>my mom and grandma would be happy.</i>

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.730
<b>Get better soon, okay? 
Miku</b>

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.540
<i>Is what I'm doing hypocrisy,</i>

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.020
<i>like Shirabe-chan says?</i>

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.650
<i>Even if I do my best,</i>

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:02.940
<i>is hurting people all I can do?</i>

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.740
A scar?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.890
I'm so sorry!

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.560
I must have really worried you.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.370
You're looking better than I expected.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.560
Well, this is a good opportunity 
for you to take a break.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.320
You know me,

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:44.470
taking breaks and slacking off are my specialties!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.070
Leave it to me!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.630
Are you really all right?

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.010
You aren't trying to act like you're okay

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:53.440
to make us feel better, are you?

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:57.060
No, that isn't—

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.880
Tsubasa-san, that hurts.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.380
I'm sorry.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.860
What's going on?

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.300
The reason you've been acting weird lately

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.720
isn't to try to imitate this dummy, is it?

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.110
I'm sorry.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.620
If it's really nothing, then it's fine...

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:22.980
The Moon will crash into the Earth.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.670
This issue concerns the Lunar Attack.

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.770
I'd like to reach someone from the 
Independent State of Sherje.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.080
Shouldn't we ask for America's help?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:33.040
Given the fact that we can't trust the 
information from their government,

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.580
that's impossible!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:37.130
There's too much unknown 
about the Apollo Project.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.370
Even Thomas Paine, the director at the time...

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.710
I've contacted Dr. Kuzumi, at Jounan University.

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:44.280
There's no time to waste.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:47.260
Our priority needs to be calculating the Moon's orbit.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.070
I'm saying, you can't act on your own!

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:51.570
We need time to smooth things over

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:53.720
with the appropriate agencies first.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:00.880
I have a message from an anonymous 
whistleblower called "Laika Came Back."

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.630
It's coming from...

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.420
the old Soviet Space Agency?

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.420
What's this?

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.560
Part of Hibiki-kun's body,

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.990
which was extracted during the medical check.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.250
The Gungnir in her chest?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.210
The result of materializing and dematerializing

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.500
her Symphogear is that it's invading

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.760
her body even more deeply.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:31.150
Her body and the relic are becoming one?

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.120
That's the source of her

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.430
explosive power as a wielder.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.260
Does this fusion threaten her in any way?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.370
She'll probably be dead soon.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:57.680
Tachibana will die... She'll die?

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.370
That's impossible.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.260
Even if she doesn't,

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.300
if the fusion proceeds any further,

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:06.280
will she still

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:09.380
even be human?

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.640
It's ironic,

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.050
but the data acquired

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:21.720
when she went out of control alerted us
 to a danger we had no idea about.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.220
Tachibana's breaking...

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.250
The Moon's broken.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.150
FIS talks a good game

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.990
about saving humanity when the Moon falls,

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.840
but they're gleefully using Noise 
to take human lives.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:41.330
We can't let them do this.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.080
But...

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.510
How much can we do

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.970
without Hibiki-kun?

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.040
Even so,

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.430
we can't let Tachibana fight anymore.

00:15:56.650 --> 00:16:00.810
With my protector's blade, I shall 
handle all the danger myself.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.100
Hey...

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.940
Did the old man say something to you?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.190
He told me that

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.610
a weakling who goes out of control

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:16.130
when they run into a tough opponent, 
can't be counted on in battle.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.120
He's telling you not to fight anymore.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.310
Never use your Gear again. 
You're just slowing us down!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.790
Are you serious?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.600
Hey! Say something!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.730
Chris-chan!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:33.860
It's okay.

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.670
It's true that

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:40.770
I'm weak and I went out of control...

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.770
Yukine and I will handle FIS ourselves.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.910
Section 2 Intelligence is handling

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.530
the search for the missing Dr. Ver.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:57.160
We do not need the tiny amount 
of help Tachibana can offer.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.450
Wait, damn it! Hey!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.960
What the hell are you doing?!

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.730
So here you are...

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:35.970
As long as I have this, I'll be a hero!

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:49.250
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:58.170
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.470
<i>Such a gentle girl.</i>

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.250
<i>The stars were born.</i>

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.260
<i>And it isn't just Maria.</i>

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.250
<i>I'm giving those gentle girls</i>

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.890
<i>such a heavy cross to bear.</i>

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:07.320
<i>The songs were born.</i>

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:17.190
<i>The Lulu Amel smiled for eternity.</i>

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:21.700
<i>The stars kissed.</i>

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:20.950
<i>I may...</i>

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.790
<i>be wrong.</i>

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:25.890
<i>The songs slept.</i>

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.960
It's me.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.960
Is... Is that you, Mom?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.190
Are you doing better?

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.720
With Maria's help, I got through the worst of it.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.190
I'm glad.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.390
Yeah.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.910
S-So, Mom...

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:49.560
We're supposed to be standing by, 
but the reason we're out walking is...

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.210
I know.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.870
Maria's instructions, yes?

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:58.610
Only the doctor can help you get better.

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.340
But we can't get a hold of him.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.120
Thank you, both of you.

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:07.800
All right, as soon as you find 
the doctor, contact me.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.120
I'll send you the rendezvous point.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.680
Roger!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:18.410
I didn't expect Mom to pick up...

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.850
I'm really glad, though.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:21.590
Yeah.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.130
This is what happens the minute you relax.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.440
We haven't had a bite to eat all day.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:33.410
What should we do?

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.590
Find something to eat around here?

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:36.870
Yeah...

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:41.360
But we need to hurry and find the doctor.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:43.860
Yeah.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.120
Let's do that!

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.120
<b>Flower</b>

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:59.200
You really think a teenage girl

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.010
should be eating all that fried stuff, though?

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.560
Hey!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.680
Y-Yeah...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:12.850
Well, Auntie's okonomiyaki is 
definitely the best around!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.350
I'm glad I invited you, then.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.360
I'm glad she looked like she was doing well, too.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:21.360
It isn't as easy to visit her as it used to be.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.990
But I bet it cheered up Bikky a little.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:32.540
You're as dense as a harem anime protagonist!

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:38.380
A certain someone's been really worried 
about how down you've looked lately,

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:41.350
so we decided to have an okonomiyaki party.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.180
Miku...

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.020
What was that?

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:14.780
Whoever comes after me...

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.040
I can't let them have this.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.230
Dr. Ver...

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.850
Wh-Why are you here?!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:37.800
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:40.190
Hibiki!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.860
She touched a Noise while she was still human?

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.820
My fists... And my life...

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:06.930
Both are my Symphogear!
